      "seed": 1645877977,
      "version": 292,
      "versionNonce": 659508409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786190870416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- inside the api will create [google] folder then [blocking] folder\n    - the final route \"localhost:3001/api/google/blocking\"\n    - so: call POST request \"localhost:3001/api/google/blocking\" will google gemini provider\n      to generate something... ✨",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- inside the api will create [google] folder then [blocking] folder\n    - the final route \"localhost:3001/api/google/blocking\"\n    - so: call POST request \"localhost:3001/api/google/blocking\" will google gemini provider\n      to generate something... ✨",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kZUQDiFYUemprkcVSfFKQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 741.4677223708303,
      "y": 2232.50963700398,
      "width": 1053.579345703125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1rV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1074920693,
      "version": 1011,
      "versionNonce": 204889638,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786211879737,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "try the background job \"inngest.send\" ->  inside the api will create [google] folder then [background] folder\n    - the final route \"localhost:3001/api/google/background/route\"\n    - call this route from the client side fetch in page.tsx\n    - await inngest.send({name: \"google/generate\",data: {}}) -> inside the background/route.ts\n    - then the background job will run and google gemini \n      will  generate something... ✨\n    - go to the \"\"http://localhost:8288/runs\" to trace the background job status",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "try the background job \"inngest.send\" ->  inside the api will create [google] folder then [background] folder\n    - the final route \"localhost:3001/api/google/background/route\"\n    - call this route from the client side fetch in page.tsx\n    - await inngest.send({name: \"google/generate\",data: {}}) -> inside the background/route.ts\n    - then the background job will run and google gemini \n      will  generate something... ✨\n    - go to the \"\"http://localhost:8288/runs\" to trace the background job status",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
