      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4-Run the Next.js Server with HTTPS:\n   -Ensure your package.json dev script looks like this:",
